# Prism Day — Prism's Day terminal colors (Refraction).
# Ptyxis: save as ~/.local/share/org.gnome.Ptyxis/palettes/prism-day.palette
# (Flatpak: ~/.var/app/app.devsuite.Ptyxis/data/org.gnome.Ptyxis/palettes/), restart Ptyxis,
# then Preferences → Profile → Palette → "Prism Day".

[Palette]
